r effectively controlling the flow) can easily beat it. If I take the lead, I dictate the flow.\n\nReason: I need to protect the teammate and feed them a card they can easily beat or play on. Winning with the 2 takes control away from the Landlord, and allows me to lead my single 4, which is the ideal card to pass the turn to the teammate. This maximizes the teammate\'s chance to empty their hand (3 cards left).\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♦2"]}'}
